WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.394 --> 00:00:20.936
Saturday morning Riley put her Supertrek on the bike rack and climbed into the car with the rest

2
00:00:20.976 --> 00:00:21.617
of her family.

3
00:00:21.637 --> 00:00:25.538
"Ready, Riley?"

4
00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:28.960
Mr. Clark asked as they drove toward the tryout trail.

5
00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:34.269
"As ready as I'll ever be," Riley murmured.

6
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.890
"She's ready," Jordan said.

7
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.771
"I have confidence in her."

8
00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:41.312
"Me too," Mrs.

9
00:00:41.352 --> 00:00:41.953
Clark said.

10
00:00:41.973 --> 00:00:44.134
"Hey, what's going on?"

11
00:00:44.894 --> 00:00:47.715
Riley said as they pulled into the parking lot at the field.

12
00:00:50.317 --> 00:00:54.098
Two police cars sat side by side, their lights flashing.

13
00:00:54.118 --> 00:00:57.640
"Oh no Jordan murmured.

14
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:04.583
The Blue Demons' new trail was filled with deep holes and tire tracks from several large vehicles.

15
00:01:06.284 --> 00:01:09.666
"Maybe vandals drove all over the soft dirt," Mr.

16
00:01:09.706 --> 00:01:10.286
Clark said.

17
00:01:11.347 --> 00:01:12.127
Riley nodded.

18
00:01:12.808 --> 00:01:16.910
The jumps were gone, and trash was strewn all around the track.

19
00:01:17.871 --> 00:01:23.694
Coach Adams and two other men were talking to the police officers as riders looked on, disbelief and

20
00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:25.055
anger on their faces.

21
00:01:25.715 --> 00:01:27.476
Riley and Jordan joined the group.

22
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.282
"The track is toast," Delaney said when he saw them.

23
00:01:31.962 --> 00:01:35.724
"Some jerks in four-wheel trucks thought it would be fun to trash our track."

24
00:01:36.985 --> 00:01:38.966
Sofia's eyes burned with anger.

25
00:01:38.986 --> 00:01:42.188
"We spent a year raising money to build this track.

26
00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.529
Then in one night, somebody ruined it!"

27
00:01:44.549 --> 00:01:47.290
"Do the police know who did this?"

28
00:01:47.731 --> 00:01:48.451
Jordan asked.

29
00:01:48.471 --> 00:01:55.074
"Mr. Ravi, the guy who sold us the land, saw a bunch of guys driving trucks past his

30
00:01:55.135 --> 00:01:57.536
farm last night," Delaney replied.

31
00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.361
"But it was late.

32
00:01:59.841 --> 00:02:01.463
He didn't get a good look at the drivers."

33
00:02:02.584 --> 00:02:05.146
Coach Adams called for everyone to gather around.

34
00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.672
thank you for coming today," he began.

35
00:02:11.692 --> 00:02:14.234
"As you can see, we've got a problem.

36
00:02:14.854 --> 00:02:18.598
Last night vandals damaged our track, and it's not usable today.

37
00:02:19.498 --> 00:02:21.880
The police assure me they'll find out who did this."

38
00:02:23.462 --> 00:02:25.644
He glanced over the crowd of eager riders.

39
00:02:26.824 --> 00:02:30.106
"Racing season starts soon so we need to hold our tryout quickly.

40
00:02:30.926 --> 00:02:33.907
Luckily, the racing community has stepped up to help."

41
00:02:35.028 --> 00:02:37.389
He motioned for the second man to step forward.

42
00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:43.452
"This is Coach Hopewell, the head coach of the Racing Raptors."

43
00:02:45.172 --> 00:02:47.013
Everyone looked at each other in surprise.

44
00:02:48.094 --> 00:02:51.075
The Racing Raptors were the Blue Demons' biggest rivals.

45
00:02:51.855 --> 00:02:53.216
What was the coach doing here?

46
00:02:54.336 --> 00:02:59.158
"Coach Hopewell has offered to let us use their track instead," Coach Adams went on.

47
00:03:00.139 --> 00:03:02.900
Riley gasped and clapped a hand to her mouth.

48
00:03:05.061 --> 00:03:09.483
The Racing Raptors' track was on Hawk Mountain—where Jordan had her accident!

49
00:03:09.503 --> 00:03:13.424
"This feels like a bad omen," Riley thought.

50
00:03:14.345 --> 00:03:19.947
The crowd broke up, and everyone headed to their cars for the thirty-minute drive up Hawk Mountain to

51
00:03:19.987 --> 00:03:21.248
the Racing Raptors' track.

52
00:03:24.476 --> 00:03:27.477
Riley was quiet as her family pulled out of the parking lot.

53
00:03:29.758 --> 00:03:31.999
"You'll be fine," Jordan said quickly.

54
00:03:32.019 --> 00:03:36.441
"The Racing Raptors' track is almost exactly like the Demons' practice track."

55
00:03:38.082 --> 00:03:39.062
Riley shook her head.

56
00:03:39.082 --> 00:03:42.523
"I didn't get to test much of the practice track, remember?

57
00:03:42.943 --> 00:03:43.704
I crashed.

58
00:03:44.124 --> 00:03:49.586
Plus, the Racing Raptors' track is where—" "Never mind," Jordan cut her off.

59
00:03:50.567 --> 00:03:53.948
"Stop thinking about that, and focus on your ride."

60
00:03:54.996 --> 00:03:58.338
Riley nodded and then turned to stare out the car window.

61
00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:02.361
At the Racing Raptors' track, Mrs.

62
00:04:02.401 --> 00:04:04.522
Clark went with Riley to the sign-up table.

63
00:04:07.884 --> 00:04:13.688
Mrs. Clark signed the waivers, and Riley showed her USA Cycling membership card without saying a word.

64
00:04:15.169 --> 00:04:16.830
Sofia handed her a race number.

65
00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.451
"Good luck, Riley."

66
00:04:18.471 --> 00:04:23.325
"Thanks." Riley and her mother headed to where Mr.

67
00:04:23.365 --> 00:04:25.565
Clark had set up chairs to watch the race.

68
00:04:28.346 --> 00:04:33.387
Riley handed Jordan her number, and Jordan carefully pinned it onto Riley's jersey.

69
00:04:33.407 --> 00:04:38.689
"Sixteen is my lucky number," Jordan said with a smile.

70
00:04:38.709 --> 00:04:41.650
"And it brought you terrible luck!"

71
00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.070
Riley burst out.

72
00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.711
"Riley, listen to me.

73
00:04:46.471 --> 00:04:48.272
You're going to have a great ride.

74
00:04:48.692 --> 00:04:49.552
And you're not me.

75
00:04:50.472 --> 00:04:52.354
In fact, you're a better rider than I am.

76
00:04:53.495 --> 00:04:55.617
You've got a lot more determination than I do.

77
00:04:55.637 --> 00:04:57.819
I've always been jealous of that."

78
00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.162
"Really?" Riley stared at her sister, surprised.

79
00:05:02.182 --> 00:05:08.888
"I might be the speed queen, but focus and determination are the things that win the race," Jordan

80
00:05:08.948 --> 00:05:09.589
said firmly.

81
00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:13.332
"Wherever the brain goes, the body follows."

82
00:05:14.493 --> 00:05:19.782
Riley threw her arms around her sister in a strong hug, afraid if she said anything, she'd burst

83
00:05:19.822 --> 00:05:20.402
into tears.

84
00:05:23.044 --> 00:05:24.185
Jordan hugged her back.

85
00:05:24.866 --> 00:05:25.326
"Good luck."

86
00:05:27.028 --> 00:05:27.748
Riley nodded.

87
00:05:27.768 --> 00:05:32.172
"Thanks." Then she suddenly spotted Quinn among a group of riders.

88
00:05:33.693 --> 00:05:39.238
Her fancy bike shone like it had just come out of the store, and several people stood admiring

89
00:05:39.318 --> 00:05:42.701
it. "Maybe I'll wish her luck," Riley thought.

90
00:05:43.361 --> 00:05:46.484
Quinn was annoying, but good sportsmanship was important.

91
00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:50.421
Especially if they were going to be on the same team after today.

92
00:05:51.202 --> 00:05:52.622
Riley approached the other girl.

93
00:05:52.642 --> 00:05:57.584
"Hey," Quinn said coldly.

94
00:05:57.604 --> 00:06:02.446
"Look, I'm sorry about what happened in the gym," Riley began.

95
00:06:02.467 --> 00:06:05.368
"I didn't mean to sound like a know-it-all."

96
00:06:06.488 --> 00:06:08.869
"Whatever." Quinn looked down at her feet.

97
00:06:08.889 --> 00:06:13.591
"Well, good luck with your ride," Riley said.

98
00:06:13.611 --> 00:06:17.798
"And trust me, I'm really not trying to sabotage you."

99
00:06:18.498 --> 00:06:19.138
She smiled.

100
00:06:19.159 --> 00:06:23.742
"When I make the team, I'll need a good teammate like you."

101
00:06:24.562 --> 00:06:25.283
She turned to go.

102
00:06:25.303 --> 00:06:28.225
"What do you think of this trail?"

103
00:06:28.885 --> 00:06:29.866
Quinn asked abruptly.

104
00:06:31.327 --> 00:06:32.087
Riley halted.

105
00:06:32.107 --> 00:06:35.810
"Everyone says it's a lot like the Demons' practice trail.

106
00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.852
But it's longer and has a couple of extra jumps.

107
00:06:40.993 --> 00:06:42.654
One of the jumps is pretty tough."

108
00:06:44.015 --> 00:06:44.836
"Have you ever made it?"

109
00:06:45.524 --> 00:06:47.025
Quinn asked, eyeing the track.

110
00:06:47.946 --> 00:06:49.566
"Nope," Riley replied.

111
00:06:49.586 --> 00:06:51.448
"It's my first ride here.

112
00:06:52.128 --> 00:06:54.629
But this is the trail where Jordan had her accident."

113
00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:57.991
"Oh!" Quinn exclaimed.

114
00:06:58.712 --> 00:07:02.014
She looked closely at Riley, and Riley suddenly flushed.

115
00:07:03.334 --> 00:07:07.057
Why had she just blurted that out—to Quinn, of all people?

116
00:07:08.778 --> 00:07:11.099
Riley waved before Quinn could say anything more.

117
00:07:11.119 --> 00:07:12.640
"See you later."

118
00:07:13.472 --> 00:07:16.614
Then she hurried back to her family to wait for the tryout to start.

119
00:07:19.515 --> 00:07:22.357
A few minutes later Coach Adams lifted a megaphone.

120
00:07:22.377 --> 00:07:26.499
"Good morning, riders.

121
00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.302
I truly appreciate your patience with our last-minute location change.

122
00:07:31.102 --> 00:07:33.463
It's finally time to get this event started."

123
00:07:33.483 --> 00:07:37.606
"Woo-hoo!" Riders cheered loudly.

124
00:07:37.626 --> 00:07:45.190
"As you know," the coach went on, "today's race is for riders to qualify for the Blue Demons

125
00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:50.093
team. The two riders in each age group with the best times will make the team.

126
00:07:51.154 --> 00:07:53.935
We'll start with the junior division, ages 9 to 12.

127
00:07:54.476 --> 00:07:55.736
Good luck, everyone!"

128
00:07:56.697 --> 00:07:59.319
The riders lined up according to their age and gender.

129
00:08:02.441 --> 00:08:06.743
Riley and Quinn were the oldest to try out in the girls' junior division, so they were at

130
00:08:06.783 --> 00:08:07.724
the rear of the line.

131
00:08:11.048 --> 00:08:12.989
Riley looked over the younger riders.

132
00:08:13.869 --> 00:08:17.971
One or two girls were fast riders, but they were probably nothing to worry about.

133
00:08:19.011 --> 00:08:23.473
Even if Quinn posted the fastest time, Riley could still win a spot on the team.

134
00:08:24.554 --> 00:08:25.574
She swallowed hard.

135
00:08:27.115 --> 00:08:29.616
If she didn't get spooked by those jumps.
